OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 16 AUG
OL,4,CBROADCAST STUDIOS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1957FBBC Scotland opens its first
OL,7,Fpermanent TV studio, at the former
OL,8,FBlack Cat Cinema in Glasgow.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIt was commonly referred to as the
OL,11,FSpringfield Road studio and was used to
OL,12,Fproduce early Scottish programming,
OL,13,Fincluding the White Heather Club.
OL,14,
OL,15,FThe studio ceased operations in 1964
OL,16,Fwhen it was replaced by Studio A at BBC
OL,17,FBroadcasting House, Glasgow.
